$model_ah_train_lora — QLoRA fine-tune Anthill codegen model

SUMMARY
  Trains a LoRA adapter from JSONL in files[] (from $model_ah_create_jsonl).
  Requires uv sync --extra finetune and HF instruct weights (model=1.5b).

SYNTAX
  @lora: @jsonl -> $model_ah_train_lora(model='1.5b', epochs=2)

INPUT
  files[] — JSONL training file

OUTPUT
  files[] — .zip of LoRA adapter (adapter_config.json + weights)

ARGUMENTS
  model= — 1.5b (default)
  epochs=, batch_size=, grad_accum=, lr=, max_seq_len=
  lora_r=, lora_alpha=, save_steps=, qlora=true|false
  output_name= — zip basename (default lora_adapter)

ENV
  AH_EMULATE_MODEL_AH_TRAIN_LORA=1 — stub adapter for tests

PROMPT-CONSUMING
  No.
